/target

# Backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
**/mutants.out*/

# The dashboard's config, which holds its access token. Running the dashboard
# from a checkout would otherwise leave a secret sitting in the working tree.
/serial-tcp.json
/serial-tcp.json.bak
